{
    "title": "Cocobi Baby Care - Babysitter",
    "description": "Meet Coco, Lobi, and friends as cute babies!\r\nTake a walk in the park, draw with paint, and travel to dreamland with the babies. Take care of all the cute Cocobi baby friends. \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Take Care of the Cute Babies \r\n-Feed the Babies: Cook and feed the baby milk, baby food, fruit purees, and more. \r\n-Change the Diaper: Change the dirty diaper!\r\n-Bathtime: Babies love baths. Bath the babies, and play bathtime games. \r\n-Sleep: It's time for bed. Travel to dreamland with the babies.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Play With the Babies \r\n-Go for a Walk: Get ready to go to the park. \r\n-Play with Trains: Build a train and play. Make the doll ride the train! \r\n-Arts and Crafts: Make something cute for the baby. Make a pretty flower crown and cute animal dolls. \r\n-Hide and Seek: Hurry and hide! Mommy is coming to find the baby! \r\n \r\n\u25a0 Special Fun Features of the Cocobi Baby Care Game \r\n-Choose a Baby: Choose from Coco, Lobi, Lara, and Lou! \r\n-Toy Surprise: Take good care of your baby and receive a surprise toy gift!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 About Kigle\r\nKigle's mission is to create the 'first playground for children all over the world' with creative content for children. We make interactive apps, videos, songs, and toys to spark children's creativity, imagination, and curiosity. In addition to our Cocobi apps, you can download and play other popular games such as Pororo, Tayo, and Robocar Poli. \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Welcome to the Cocobi universe, where dinosaurs never became extinct! Cocobi is the fun compound name for brave Coco and cute Lobi! Play with the little dinosaurs and experience the world with various jobs, duties, and places.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Coco, Lobi, and friends as cute babies!<br>Take a walk in the park, draw with paint, and travel to dreamland with the babies. Take care of all the cute Cocobi baby friends. <br><br>\u25a0 Take Care of the Cute Babies <br>-Feed the Babies: Cook and feed the baby milk, baby food, fruit purees, and more. <br>-Change the Diaper: Change the dirty diaper!<br>-Bathtime: Babies love baths. Bath the babies, and play bathtime games. <br>-Sleep: It&#39;s time for bed. Travel to dreamland with the babies.<br><br>\u25a0 Play With the Babies <br>-Go for a Walk: Get ready to go to the park. <br>-Play with Trains: Build a train and play. Make the doll ride the train! <br>-Arts and Crafts: Make something cute for the baby. Make a pretty flower crown and cute animal dolls. <br>-Hide and Seek: Hurry and hide! Mommy is coming to find the baby! <br> <br>\u25a0 Special Fun Features of the Cocobi Baby Care Game <br>-Choose a Baby: Choose from Coco, Lobi, Lara, and Lou! <br>-Toy Surprise: Take good care of your baby and receive a surprise toy gift!<br><br>\u25a0 About Kigle<br>Kigle&#39;s mission is to create the &#39;first playground for children all over the world&#39; with creative content for children. We make interactive apps, videos, songs, and toys to spark children&#39;s creativity, imagination, and curiosity. In addition to our Cocobi apps, you can download and play other popular games such as Pororo, Tayo, and Robocar Poli. <br><br>\u25a0 Welcome to the Cocobi universe, where dinosaurs never became extinct! Cocobi is the fun compound name for brave Coco and cute Lobi! Play with the little dinosaurs and experience the world with various jobs, duties, and places.",
